  "deviations": [
    "THE DELTA: measurement grid only \u2014 g2b's CELL-G2 rerun with the ruler read every 2 steps (+ step 1; 151 reads vs g2b's 9+9). The organ, root, monitor (g2b's G2BNet via module import), seed, and wash/replay arithmetic are g2b VERBATIM; run_cell is reused unmodified.",
